                <section class="api-card has-soft-icon api-section-anchor" id="overview">
                    <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Overview</h2>
                    <p>
                        The AS-Mart API provides public product and content data from AS-Mart. Other websites can use it to show
                        featured products, latest products, popular items, deals, top-rated products, category products,
                        collections, related products, and blog posts.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Only active products are returned. Use <strong>buyUrl</strong> for tracked outbound clicks and
                        <strong>productUrl</strong> for the AS-Mart product detail page.
                    </p>
                    <div class="api-soft-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i></div>
                </section>

