                        <li>CORS is enabled for approved websites such as asifabrar.net.</li>
                        <li>All endpoints return JSON and should be called using HTTPS.</li>
                        <li>Use <strong>/api/widgets/home</strong> to retrieve several home-page resources in one request.</li>
